<title>USA: Bartlett, Tenn. won by J.C Bradford. [CORRECTED 23:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bartlett, Tenn. won by J.C Bradford. [CORRECTED 23:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford (Corrects from Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., Inc.) said it won $9.970 million of Bartlett, Tenn., various general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.146134 percent (corrects from 5.145 percent).</p>
</text>
